{"id":"245143","name":"茶叶蛋","author":"涵宝de妈","authorId":"8119640","desc":"","cover":"images/245143/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"10个"},{"name":"茶叶","amount":"6g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"12g"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"25g"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"3g"},{"name":"八角","amount":"7g"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备花椒和八角，加起来一共10g；鸡蛋清洗干净","img":"images/245143/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加适量清水，放入清洗好的鸡蛋","img":"images/245143/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入花椒和八角","img":"images/245143/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"茶叶清水洗一下","img":"images/245143/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入茶叶","img":"images/245143/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入老抽和盐","img":"images/245143/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上盖子中火煮沸，煮沸后打开盖子，再煮五分钟左右","img":"images/245143/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将煮好的鸡蛋用勺子敲碎蛋壳","img":"images/245143/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"敲碎后放回锅中继续煮，小火煮1个小时左右","img":"images/245143/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮好后腌制一夜","img":"images/245143/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品","img":"images/245143/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}